            "review_title": "Review at Phe La - Bien Hoa",
            "review_text": "BaoYing\n1 contribution\n0\nIt's a place to experience.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nThe milk tea shop is clean and comfortable, the staff are very welcoming. Vanilla milk tea is creamy, with a touch of vanilla, just right sweet and not too greasy. Oolong Pearl tastes Q-bomb chewy, and also carries a light scent of oolong tea, which goes very well with milk tea. Overall, the drinks were of good quality and reasonably priced. I was satisfied and will be back again next time. Recommended for everyone to try!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten July 23, 2026",
